# MCP Client Configuration

File: ooda/mcp/docs/client_config.oot

## 1. Launching the server

```sh
ooda mcp              # stdio
ooda mcp request.txt  # one-shot
```

## 2. Editor configuration

For Claude Desktop:
```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "openooda": {
      "command": "ooda",
      "args": ["mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```
